  "title": "Chapter 5: Gupta Empire",
  "order": 5,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bhxiroc",
      "content": "The Gupta Empire is known as the 'Golden Age of Ancient India'. It witnessed great achievements in administration, science, literature, art, and culture."
    },
    {
      "type": "statStrip",
      "stats": [
        {
          "label": "Samudragupta Reign",
          "value": "335–375 CE",
          "icon": "calendar"
        },
        {
          "label": "Chandragupta II Reign",
          "value": "380–415 CE",
          "icon": "clock"
        },
        {
          "label": "Historical Era",
          "value": "Gupta Empire",
          "icon": "book"
        }
      ],
      "id": "3t6u3d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "5e3iach",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Rise of the Gupta Empire"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The chapter covers the rise, administration, and eventual decline of the Gupta Empire.",
        "Key rulers detailed include Samudragupta (335–375 CE) and Chandragupta II (Vikramaditya) (380–415 CE).",
        "Major focus areas encompass Gupta economy, art and architecture, literature, education, and science & technology."
      ],
      "id": "bjbohog"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qdb6s8f",
      "content": "• The Gupta Empire was founded by Sri Gupta around 240 CE."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "k20b3a8",
      "content": "• The Guptas initially ruled a small kingdom in eastern Uttar Pradesh and Bihar."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a4ibpld",
      "content": "• The real expansion of the empire started with Chandragupta I."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vpzfwgk",
      "content": "• Chandragupta I assumed the title 'Maharajadhiraja'."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "h3a7c8g",
      "content": "• His marriage with Lichchhavi princess Kumaradevi strengthened the Gupta power."
    },
    {
      "id": "8uygrcg",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2. Important Gupta Rulers"
    },
