          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Aryabhata</p>",
            "<p>Famous mathematician and astronomer</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Varahamihira</p>",
            "<p>Astronomer and scientist</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Vishnu Sharma</p>",
            "<p>Author of Panchatantra</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mundxhw",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. Science and Technology"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "blspxtq",
      "content": "• Aryabhata discovered that the Earth rotates on its axis."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "kivgpir",
      "content": "• The concept of zero was developed."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "q3mvsdf",
      "content": "• Advancements were made in astronomy and mathematics."
    },
    {
      "id": "byu5nyr",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "10. Decline of the Gupta Empire"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xk43qi3",
      "content": "• Weak successors after Skandagupta."
    },
